            "en": "Huwa alladhi khalaqa as-samawati wal-arda fi sittati ayyam: it is He who created the heavens and the earth in six days. The commentators say little about the days themselves, and this article says no more than they do. At-Tabari glosses the clause as ansha'a, brought into being: He brought into being the seven heavens and the earths, then ordered them and all that is in them. Ibn Kathir and the Muyassar both add wa ma baynahuma, and what is between them, so that the span takes in the heavens, the earth and everything between.",
